        {
          "version": "1.4.36",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-marketplace/releases/download/v1.4.36/marketplace.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T19:44:16.819Z",
          "changelog": "- 确认计划过期（卡摆了超过 5 分钟才点确认）不再静默当取消：提示「确认已过期，请重新发起」。",
          "sha256": "efd069b02b316659dd12a50d1b960f78ede1af6e1d0ce51fff26984d14de61b0"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.4.35",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-marketplace/releases/download/v1.4.35/marketplace.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T19:34:31.814Z",
          "changelog": "- **风险分档**：壳在 `prepare*` 回执里给出 `cardOwner`——首装 / 来源变更 / 降级 / 未信任来源 = `host`（壳画，用户看到的内容有壳背书）；官方同源、已信任来源只是开关关着 = `market`（市场自绘）。市场收到 `host` 时丢弃计划、改走 `requestInstall`/`requestUpdateBatch`，不硬画。",
          "sha256": "1ae1912cd3315fab7db681bc9e9c56ee8c5f2e8f53181a9b3be9489a3f58a165"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.4.34",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-marketplace/releases/download/v1.4.34/marketplace.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T17:52:15.447Z",
          "changelog": "- 补 5 条插件字典英文（版本过旧 ×3 / 目录无此插件 / 缺目录条目）——`check-i18n-surface` 转绿。",
          "sha256": "d4081cef03f6ff2c943b4a8763b576b55512bf64c9a54a035be9f5e738461e78"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.4.33",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-marketplace/releases/download/v1.4.33/marketplace.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T17:45:36.010Z",
          "changelog": "- **确认卡由市场自绘**（D8′）：安装/更新/批量更新改走两步 API——`prepareInstall`/`prepareUpdateBatch` 拿壳算的 `plan`，需要确认时用 `dialog.confirmContent` 弹出**市场自己的视图**（`marketplace-install-confirm` / `marketplace-update-batch`，内容用 `@linkdesk/ui` 共享件），用户确认后 `commitInstall(planId)`；取消 ⇒ `discardInstall`。\n  - 判定/令牌/执行仍在壳；⛔ 市场不拼来源/版本/哈希（只吃壳的 `view.plan`）。\n  - 全免问（ask 为空）不弹卡；壳无两步面 ⇒ 回落 `requestInstall` 快捷路径（壳画默认卡）。\n- 清理：删掉自造确认载荷（`installConfirmPayload()`）与旧 `ConfirmInstall` 版式，改为壳数据 + 共享件。\n- 翻译：补 5 条英文（发起方 / AI 与三条错误提示，随 lang-defaults 1.0.82）。",
          "sha256": "12c62bcb21b53b50383bb15dcfcf889bfbbe455888e6c00a8e7de6ae74f49692"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.4.32",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-marketplace/releases/download/v1.4.32/marketplace.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T16:16:01.715Z",
          "changelog": "- 内务：批量更新回执类型去掉壳从不返回的 `jobIds`（壳不建 job 表，改了契约）；行为零变化。"
